  "https://www.asateengroup.com/master-cts/master-bar": "01 Master Bar Corrosion-resistant reinforcement for structures exposed to salinity, heat, and lifecycle durability constraints.",
  "https://www.asateengroup.com/master-cts/master-board": "02 Master Board Fiber-cement board systems for controlled envelopes, lining, and industrialized dry construction packages.",
  "https://www.asateengroup.com/master-cts/master-brick": "03 Master Brick Architectural clay facing units for durable cladding, severe exposure conditions, and specification-led facade delivery.",
  "https://www.asateengroup.com/master-cts/master-flok": "04 MASTER FLOK Cold recycling and in-situ stabilization for road foundations, corridor rehabilitation, and base performance recovery.",
  "https://www.asateengroup.com/master-cts/master-foam-concrete": "08 Master Foam Concrete Controlled lightweight cementitious fill for leveling layers, cavities, and support zones where mass control matters.",
  "https://www.asateengroup.com/master-cts/master-gccm": "05 Master GCCM Rapid-deployment cementitious lining for canal protection, erosion control, and hydraulic corridor management.",
  "https://www.asateengroup.com/master-cts/master-green-building": "06 Master Green Building Integrated light steel building system coordinating structure, envelope, infill, and facade layers under one delivery logic.",
  "https://www.asateengroup.com/master-cts/master-rephos": "07 MASTER REPHOS Chemical neutralization and recovery pathway for phosphogypsum where environmental control and resource output must coexist."
